OL,3,GNEWSAMercury Prize judges greeted by
OL,4,Achoir ahead of 2026 ceremony
OL,5,
OL,6,FJudges are arriving in Newcastle ahead
OL,7,Fof the 2026 Mercury Prize ceremony.
OL,9,FThe panel arrived at Newcastle's
OL,10,Fcentral railway station to the welcome
OL,11,Fof the LNER Mini Mercury Choir, an
OL,12,Fassembly of children from across the
OL,13,Fcity - including Hotspur Primary
OL,14,FSchool, Regent Farm First School, the
OL,15,FGosforth Voices choir, and the
OL,16,FNewcastle Children's Choir.
OL,18,FIt is the music awards' second year in
OL,19,Fthe city, with Geordie Sam Fender
OL,20,Ftaking home the prize in 2025 for his
OL,21,Falbum People Watching.
OL,23,APub: 22-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
